Package: ubuntu-gts9u-companion
Version: 1:0.9.0
Section: oldlibs
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: galaxy-companion (>= 1:0.9.0)
Maintainer: Ubuntu gts9uwifi port contributors <noreply@example.invalid>
Description: Transitional package: Tab Companion is now Galaxy Companion
 Tab Companion, this port's settings application, became Galaxy Companion and
 moved to its own repository (https://github.com/agcarbajo/galaxy-companion),
 where device profiles let it serve other Samsung devices too. This empty
 package keeps the old name installable so that updaters which still require
 ubuntu-gts9u-companion in an update payload pull galaxy-companion in. It can
 be removed once galaxy-companion is installed.
